abstract: "Audited single-subject structural MRI workflow using FreeSurfer for cortical reconstruction, subcortical segmentation, regional cortical-thickness, area and volume extraction, topology validation, and visual quality control. Seven public morphometry tables were independently regenerated exactly from the canonical FreeSurfer statistics."
